{"id": 43795861, "slug": "food-vs-oil", "title": "Food vs Oil", "subtitle": "Investor Update - March 29th, 2020", "post_date": "2021-11-09T20:51:25.623Z", "audience": "everyone", "wordcount": 800, "reaction_count": 0, "comment_count": 0, "restacks": 0, "reactions": {"\u2764": 0}, "body_html": "<p><strong>COVID&nbsp;+ OPEC = Deflation&nbsp;</strong></p><p>While on its own COVID19 would be plenty painful, what's interesting is that this&nbsp;<strong>massive contraction in energy demand</strong>&nbsp;is hitting at the same time that the OPEC&nbsp;+ Russia cartel is breaking down and we are getting a&nbsp;<strong>large expansion in energy supply</strong>.</p><p>Stay Home.&nbsp; Don't fly to the Olympics.&nbsp; Don't spend the weekend going to the outlet mall.&nbsp; And Coachella?&nbsp;Not happening.</p><p>Meanwhile, at least on paper, the Saudi's are prepared to pump until they kill the competition.</p><p>So, what happens when you have a lot of oil no one wants on the same day investors (and corporates, and households) are rushing to cash?</p><p><strong>Dollar Squeeze</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Deflationary Markets</strong>.&nbsp; Twin pillars of a financial risk&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><em>I don't care about your business prospects, I just want cash today pls thanks.</em></p><p></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LTKH!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67e3d120-6716-4399-b5a4-926e8309e456_1597x736.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LTKH!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67e3d120-6716-4399-b5a4-926e8309e456_1597x736.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LTKH!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67e3d120-6716-4399-b5a4-926e8309e456_1597x736.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LTKH!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67e3d120-6716-4399-b5a4-926e8309e456_1597x736.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LTKH!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67e3d120-6716-4399-b5a4-926e8309e456_1597x736.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LTKH!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67e3d120-6716-4399-b5a4-926e8309e456_1597x736.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"671\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/67e3d120-6716-4399-b5a4-926e8309e456_1597x736.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:671,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:274819,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LTKH!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67e3d120-6716-4399-b5a4-926e8309e456_1597x736.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LTKH!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67e3d120-6716-4399-b5a4-926e8309e456_1597x736.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LTKH!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67e3d120-6716-4399-b5a4-926e8309e456_1597x736.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LTKH!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F67e3d120-6716-4399-b5a4-926e8309e456_1597x736.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Two weeks ago we sold equity volatility.&nbsp; At the end of last week, we bought back our short.&nbsp; Up 1.5% in 7 days on one trade isn't bad in these markets.&nbsp; Now we just need to wait out the short squeeze, before we go (probably) go lower.</p><p><strong>Food vs Oil</strong></p><p>All this talk of a potential Great Depression got us thinking about (relative) commodity price swings.</p><p>See, there's a little energy in everything, and food is no different.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>It's not just the cost of plowing the fields, or transporting the goods to market.&nbsp; Due to ethanol, and a host of other ways we turn biological energy back into mechanical energy, to some extent the calories in your dessert are now direct substitutes for the calories in your gas tank.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!km_x!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5c6dc731-c8b0-447b-9f1e-112bee01a4e6_1401x480.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!km_x!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5c6dc731-c8b0-447b-9f1e-112bee01a4e6_1401x480.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!km_x!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e